Supporting Wi-Fi Prototype

A separate Wi-Fi prototype was developed for remote control of selected EVA functions.

The prototype provides commands for:

Servo movement
OLED expressions
System status
Stop command

This prototype is maintained separately from the main EVA firmware and is not part of the primary control architecture.

